  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AGIA - Alliance for Green Infrastructure in Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AGIA&#x2019;s objective is to raise $500m for infrastructure project development in Africa, and to leverage that investment to mobilise up to $10bn of private finance. AGIA intends to achieve this by delivering through three pillars - project preparation, project development, and financing and investment.</narrative>
